Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.92,0:03:07.25,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Eu ainda sou apenas uma criança.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:08.84,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}É o que eu digo a mim mesma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:10.75,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Mas eu sei que não é exatamente por isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.05,0:03:13.38,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Um dia, todas as desculpas que eu inventei
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:14.84,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}cairão sobre mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:17.64,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Eu ainda sou apenas uma criança,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.59,0:03:19.14,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}sentada no meu pequeno quarto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:21.22,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Enquanto peso meu pedaço de felicidade,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:26.89,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}o tempo passa, e logo esqueço o que o encheu de alegria.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.40,0:03:29.81,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Não há um roteiro com falas para ler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.81,0:03:32.40,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Eu não sei como desempenhar meu papel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.94,0:03:37.74,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}De repente, tudo diante de mim desmoronou.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:40.20,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Eu sei que não estou ouvindo coisas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.32,0:03:42.33,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Não está só na minha cabeça.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:46.75,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Há uma voz que pode curar suavemente minhas feridas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.87,0:03:52.04,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFBAEFF&\blur3}Nós rimos juntas dos nossos erros combinados.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:57.72,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFBAEFF&\blur3}Mesmo que meus desejos escritos sejam desajeitados, é bom acreditar neles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:04:03.47,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFBAEFF&\blur3}Eu prometi a mim mesma que continuaria, não importa o quão longe ou por quanto tempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.51,0:04:06.98,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFBAEFF&\blur3}Eu marcharei para o escuro e o desconhecido.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:12.02,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFBAEFF&\blur3}É assustador, mas eu sei que um dia...!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.89,0:21:28.77,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}te wo suberase shizunda uso wa
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.89,0:21:33.44,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}mada soko ni ukande kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:37.65,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}miageta sora wa nigotte
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.73,0:21:43.49,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}nani ga honto itte
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.78,0:21:47.54,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}fukaku fukaku soko mukatte
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:53.71,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}negaigoto sagashi yume mogutta mama
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.79,0:22:01.68,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}makiagaru doro no naka wo nuke motto hayaku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.51,0:22:06.14,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}atatakasa dake tamochi
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.14,0:22:08.47,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}sakasa no taiyou mezashi
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.72,0:22:13.23,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}nakushita kimi no ima ai ni yukou
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:16.27,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}hanashitara shizuka de
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.27,0:22:18.73,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}omoide ga sawagashii
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:23.66,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}imi no nai kotoba ga imi ni nareta
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.78,0:22:28.87,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}sekai no oku de oboreyou
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.89,0:21:28.77,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}As mentiras que deixei escapar afundaram,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.89,0:21:33.44,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}mas ainda flutuam lá no fundo, sem desaparecer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:37.65,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}Olho para o céu e vejo que está nublado,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.73,0:21:43.49,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}alguém pode me dizer o que é real?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.78,0:21:47.54,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}Mergulhando mais fundo na água,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:53.71,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}procurando meu pequeno desejo em um vasto mar de sonhos,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.79,0:22:01.68,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}correndo para cavar sob a lama interminável e emaranhada lá embaixo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.51,0:22:06.14,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}Segurando apenas o calor dentro de mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.14,0:22:08.47,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}Correndo em direção ao reflexo da luz do sol,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.72,0:22:13.23,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}e quando eu chegar lá, talvez eu encontre o tempo que você perdeu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:16.27,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}Quando eu respirar fundo e sentir a calma,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.27,0:22:18.73,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}e lembrar quando você ria comigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:23.66,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}O som das nossas conversas vazias ganha um novo significado,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.78,0:22:28.87,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}mas, lá no fundo, estamos nos afogando.
